==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Star Peng]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns as the boss.
**6 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**6 [[J.J. Jackrabbit]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Capy|Capies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Bore]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Another weirdly basic stage for being this late in the game. [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Newtone]], along with staple anti-Reds and anti-Aliens like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]], and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] rip this stage to shreds. Cash is plentiful, so you don't even have to worry about that either.

